      "skillOrderNotes": {
        "interleave": "Agreed by all three ordering sources (docs/research/2026-10-chanter-pack.md §4.2: mmo-codex, daevaguides [couga54, aLuckyRO], aion2turkiye): Dark Crush is the top point sink from Lv 4 and Onslaught is raised early. mmo-codex then takes Spinning Strike and Recuperation; daevaguides and aion2turkiye take Incandescent Blow next, so the place of Incandescent Blow against Recuperation is not agreed. The guide follows mmo-codex's four, then the other three CONFIRMED skills; Wind's Promise goes to 10 the day it is learned (daevaguides). The order between those rules is inferred.",
        "budget": "Eight core skills to Lv 10 = 8 × 21 = 168 points (Wind's Promise, two-source, among them); then Impactful Crush to 8 = 13 (181), Tremor Crush to 8 = 13 (194), Blessing of Life to 6 = 7 (201), 2 spare. LEVEL_POINTS[45] = 203 (Metabot; aion2turkiye agrees) plus Wisdom Stones. Metabot's own build spends the last 35 differently (Impactful Crush and Blessing of Life 10, Tremor Crush 7, Inspiring Spell 5, no Wind's Promise; claim C31)."
      },
